theorem _4sqlem17 {x3 y1 z w i n: setvar} (ph: wff x3 y1 z w i) (A2 B2 C D: class x3 y1 z w i) (P: class x3 y1 z w) (R: class x3 y1 z w n) (S: class x3 y1 z w) (T: class x3 y1 z w i n) (E F G H: class x3 y1 z w i) (M: class x3 y1 z w) (N: class x3 y1 z w i):
