--| The reduced word that forms the base of the sequence in ~ efgsval is uniquely determined, given the ending representation. (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 30-Sep-2015.)
theorem efgredlemb {x3 y1 z w v t k m n a b: setvar} (ph: wff x3 y1 z w v t k m n a b) (A2 B2: class x3 y1 z w v t k m n) (D: class x3 y1 z w v k n) (P Q: class x3 k m a b) (c_sm: class w v k n) (S: class x3 y1 z w v t k m n) (T: class y1 z w v n) (U: class x3 t k m a b) (I: class k) (K L: class x3 y1 z w v t k m n) (M: class y1 z k) (V: class x3 t k m a b) (W: class):
