theorem mdetunilem9 {x3 y1 z w: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2 B2 D c_pl R c_x c_1 K N: class) (Y: class x3 y1 z w) (c_0: class):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
