  $ wceq T (co N R cmat2pmat) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv A2 cbs) $ >
  $ wceq U (cfv P cascl) $ >
  $ wceq K (cfv R cbs) $ >
  $ wceq E (cfv P cbs) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv P cascl) $ >
  $ wceq c_1 (cfv C cur) $ >
  $ wceq M (co Q c_1 c_as) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R ccrg) (wcel Q E)) (wceq M (co C (cmpt n cn0 (co (co (cv n) X c_ex) (co (cfv (cfv (cv n) (cfv Q cco1)) U) c_1 c_as) c_as)) cgsu)) $;

--| Extend class notation with the transformation of a polynomial matrix into a polynomial over matrices.
term cpm2mp: class;

--| Transformation of a polynomial matrix (over a ring) into a polynomial over matrices (over the same ring). (Contributed by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
axiom df_pm2mp {k m n r q a: setvar}:
  $ wceq cpm2mp (cmpo n r cfn cvv (cmpt m (cfv (co (cv n) (cfv (cv r) cpl1) cmat) cbs) (csb a (co (cv n) (cv r) cmat) (csb q (cfv (cv a) cpl1) (co (cv q) (cmpt k cn0 (co (co (cv m) (cv k) cdecpmat) (co (cv k) (cfv (cv a) cv1) (cfv (cfv (cv q) cmgp) cmg)) (cfv (cv q) cvsca))) cgsu))))) $;

--| Lemma for ~ pm2mpf1 . (Contributed by AV, 14-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 4-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpf1lem {k: setvar} (A2 B2: class) (C P: class k) (Q R U c_ex c_as K N: class) (X: class k):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wa (wcel U B2) (wcel K cn0))) (wceq (cfv K (cfv (co Q (cmpt k cn0 (co (co U (cv k) cdecpmat) (co (cv k) X c_ex) c_as)) cgsu) cco1)) (co U K cdecpmat)) $;

--| Value of the transformation of a polynomial matrix into a polynomial over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpval {k m: setvar} (A2: class k m) (B2: class k) (C P Q: class k m) (R: class) (T c_ex c_as: class k m) (N: class) (V: class k) (X: class k m):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R V)) (wceq T (cmpt m B2 (co Q (cmpt k cn0 (co (co (cv m) (cv k) cdecpmat) (co (cv k) X c_ex) c_as)) cgsu))) $;

--| A polynomial matrix transformed into a polynomial over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 4-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpfval {k: setvar} (A2 B2 C P Q: class k) (R: class) (T c_ex c_as: class k) (M N: class) (V X: class k):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R V) (wcel M B2)) (wceq (cfv M T) (co Q (cmpt k cn0 (co (co M (cv k) cdecpmat) (co (cv k) X c_ex) c_as)) cgsu)) $;

--| The transformation of polynomial matrices into polynomials over matrices maps polynomial matrices to polynomials over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 5-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpcl (A2 B2 C P Q R T c_ex c_as L M N X: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg) (wcel M B2)) (wcel (cfv M T) L) $;

--| The transformation of polynomial matrices into polynomials over matrices is a function mapping polynomial matrices to polynomials over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 5-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpf (A2 B2 C P Q R T c_ex c_as L N X: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wf B2 L T) $;

--| The transformation of polynomial matrices into polynomials over matrices is a 1-1 function mapping polynomial matrices to polynomials over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 14-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 6-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpf1 (A2 B2 C P Q R T c_ex c_as L N X: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wf1 B2 L T) $;

--| A coefficient of the polynomial over matrices which is the result of the transformation of a polynomial matrix is the matrix consisting of the coefficients in the polynomial entries of the polynomial matrix. (Contributed by AV, 20-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpcoe1 (A2 B2 C P Q R T c_ex c_as K M N X: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wa (wcel M B2) (wcel K cn0))) (wceq (cfv K (cfv (cfv M T) cco1)) (co M K cdecpmat)) $;

--| The transformation of the identity polynomial matrix into polynomials over matrices results in the identity of the polynomials over matrices. (Contributed by AV, 18-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem idpm2idmp (A2 B2 C P Q R T c_ex c_as N X: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq X (cfv A2 cv1) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wceq (cfv (cfv C cur) T) (cfv Q cur)) $;

--| The mapping extracting the entries of the coefficient matrices of a polynomial over matrices at a fixed position is finitely supported. (Contributed by AV, 6-Oct-2019.) (Proof shortened by AV, 23-Dec-2019.)
theorem mptcoe1matfsupp {k: setvar} (A2 Q: class k) (R I J L N O: class):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg) (wcel O L)) (wcel I N) (wcel J N)) (wbr (cmpt k cn0 (co I J (cfv (cv k) (cfv O cco1)))) (cfv R c0g) cfsupp) $;

--| Lemma for ~ mply1topmatcl . (Contributed by AV, 6-Oct-2019.)
theorem mply1topmatcllem {k: setvar} (A2: class k) (P: class) (Q: class k) (R c_x: class) (E: class k) (I J L N O: class) (Y: class k):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv P cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq E (cfv (cfv P cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq Y (cfv R cv1) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg) (wcel O L)) (wcel I N) (wcel J N)) (wbr (cmpt k cn0 (co (co I J (cfv (cv k) (cfv O cco1))) (co (cv k) Y E) c_x)) (cfv P c0g) cfsupp) $;

--| A polynomial over matrices transformed into a polynomial matrix. ` I ` is the inverse function of the transformation ` T ` of polynomial matrices into polynomials over matrices: ` ( T `` ( I `` O ) ) = O ) ` (see ~ mp2pm2mp ). (Contributed by AV, 6-Oct-2019.)
theorem mply1topmatval {i j k p: setvar} (A2: class i j k p) (P: class i j k) (Q R: class i j k p) (c_x: class i j) (E: class i j k) (I: class i j k p) (L: class i j k) (N: class k) (O: class) (V Y: class i j k):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv P cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq E (cfv (cfv P cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq Y (cfv R cv1) $ >
  $ wceq I (cmpt p L (cmpo i j N N (co P (cmpt k cn0 (co (co (cv i) (cv j) (cfv (cv k) (cfv (cv p) cco1))) (co (cv k) Y E) c_x)) cgsu))) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel N V) (wcel O L)) (wceq (cfv O I) (cmpo i j N N (co P (cmpt k cn0 (co (co (cv i) (cv j) (cfv (cv k) (cfv O cco1))) (co (cv k) Y E) c_x)) cgsu))) $;

--| A polynomial over matrices transformed into a polynomial matrix is a polynomial matrix. (Contributed by AV, 6-Oct-2019.)
theorem mply1topmatcl {i j k p: setvar} (A2 B2 C: class i j k p) (P: class) (Q: class i j k p) (R: class p) (c_x: class i j) (E: class i j k) (I: class i j k p) (L N O: class) (Y: class i j k):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv P cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq E (cfv (cfv P cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq Y (cfv R cv1) $ >
  $ wceq I (cmpt p L (cmpo i j N N (co P (cmpt k cn0 (co (co (cv i) (cv j) (cfv (cv k) (cfv (cv p) cco1))) (co (cv k) Y E) c_x)) cgsu))) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg) (wcel O L)) (wcel (cfv O I) B2) $;

--| Lemma 1 for ~ mp2pm2mp . (Contributed by AV, 9-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem mp2pm2mplem1 {i j k p: setvar} (A2: class i j k p) (P: class i j k) (Q: class i j k p) (R c_x E: class i j k) (I: class i j k p) (L: class i j k) (N: class k) (O: class) (Y: class i j k):
