theorem mp2pm2mplem2 {i j k p: setvar} (A2 B2 C: class i j k p) (P: class) (Q: class i j k p) (R: class) (c_x: class i j) (E: class i j k) (I: class i j k p) (L N O: class) (Y: class i j k):
