--| Lemma 3 for ~ mp2pm2mp . (Contributed by AV, 10-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 5-Dec-2019.)
theorem mp2pm2mplem3 {i j k p: setvar} (A2: class i j k p) (P: class) (Q: class i j k p) (R c_x: class) (E: class k) (I: class i j k p) (K: class k p) (L N O: class) (Y: class k):
  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
