--| Lemma 1 for ~ pm2mpmhm . (Contributed by AV, 21-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 6-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpmhmlem1 {k l: setvar} (x3 y1: setvar) (A2 B2 C: class) (P Q: class l) (R: class) (T: class k l) (c_ex: class k) (c_as: class) (L: class l) (N: class) (X: class k):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq C (co N P cmat) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
