  $ wceq A2 (co N R cmat) $ >
  $ wceq Q (cfv A2 cpl1) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv Q cbs) $ >
  $ wceq T (co N R cpm2mp) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (wcel N cfn) (wcel R crg)) (wa (wcel (cv x3) B2) (wcel (cv y1) B2))) (wbr (cmpt l cn0 (co (co A2 (cmpt k (co cc0 (cv l) cfz) (co (co (cv x3) (cv k) cdecpmat) (co (cv y1) (co (cv l) (cv k) cmin) cdecpmat) (cfv A2 cmulr))) cgsu) (co (cv l) X c_ex) c_as)) (cfv Q c0g) cfsupp) $;

--| Lemma 2 for ~ pm2mpmhm . (Contributed by AV, 22-Oct-2019.) (Revised by AV, 6-Dec-2019.)
theorem pm2mpmhmlem2 {x3 y1: setvar} (A2: class x3 y1) (B2: class) (C P Q: class x3 y1) (R: class) (T: class x3 y1) (N: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv R cpl1) $ >
