theorem cpmadumatpolylem1 {n s1 b: setvar} (A2: class n s1 b) (B2: class s1 b) (D P Q: class n s1 b) (R S: class s1 b) (T c_x c_xp U c_1 c_ex G c_as J: class n s1 b) (M: class s1 b) (c_mi: class n s1 b) (N: class s1 b) (W X: class n s1 b) (Y: class s1 b) (c_0 Z: class n s1 b):
