  $ wceq c_as (cfv Q cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq c_ex (cfv (cfv Q cmgp) cmg) $ >
  $ wceq U (co N R ccpmat2mat) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (w3a (wcel N cfn) (wcel R ccrg) (wcel M B2)) (wcel (cv s1) cn)) (wcel (cv b) (co B2 (co cc0 (cv s1) cfz) cmap))) (wcel (ccom U G) (co B2 cn0 cmap)) $;

