theorem cpmadumatpoly {n s1 b: setvar} (A2 B2 D P: class) (Q: class n s1 b) (R: class) (S: class s1 b) (T c_x: class) (c_xp U c_1: class s1 b) (c_ex: class n s1 b) (G I: class s1 b) (c_as: class n s1 b) (J M: class) (c_mi: class s1 b) (N: class) (W: class s1 b) (X: class n s1 b) (Y: class) (c_0: class s1 b) (Z: class):
