theorem chcoeffeqlem {n s1 b: setvar} (A2 B2: class s1 b) (C P: class n s1 b) (R: class s1 b) (T c_xp: class n s1 b) (U c_1 G c_as K M: class s1 b) (c_mi: class n s1 b) (N: class s1 b) (W: class n s1 b) (Y: class s1 b) (c_0: class n s1 b):
