theorem chcoeffeq {n s1 b: setvar} (A2 B2: class) (C: class n s1 b) (P R T: class) (c_xp U c_1 G c_as K: class s1 b) (M c_mi N: class) (W: class s1 b) (Y: class) (c_0: class s1 b):
