  $ wi ph (wcel X S) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel Y S) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr D X cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr X Y cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr Y U cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr Y (co (cfv X cfl) c1 caddc) cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wbr (cfv Y H) (cfv X H) cle) (wbr (co (cfv X H) (csb x3 X B2) cmin) (co (cfv Y H) (csb x3 Y B2) cmin) cle)) $;

--| Lemma for ~ dvfsumrlim . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 17-May-2016.)
theorem dvfsumlem3 {x3 k: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2: class x3 k) (B2: class x3) (C: class k) (D S: class) (T: class k) (U: class) (H: class x3 k) (M: class) (V: class x3 k) (X Y: class) (Z: class k):
  $ wceq S (co T cpnf cioo) $ >
  $ wceq Z (cfv M cuz) $ >
