  $ wi ph (wcel X S) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel Y S) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr D X cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr X Y cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr Y U cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wbr (cfv Y H) (cfv X H) cle) (wbr (co (cfv X H) (csb x3 X B2) cmin) (co (cfv Y H) (csb x3 Y B2) cmin) cle)) $;

--| Lemma for ~ dvfsumrlim . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 18-May-2016.)
theorem dvfsumlem4 {x3 k: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2: class x3 k) (B2: class x3) (C: class k) (D S: class) (T: class k) (U: class) (G: class x3 k) (M: class) (V: class x3 k) (X Y: class) (Z: class k):
  $ wceq S (co T cpnf cioo) $ >
  $ wceq Z (cfv M cuz) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel M cz) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel D cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr M (co D c1 caddc) cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel T cr) $ >
  $ wi (wa ph (wcel (cv x3) S)) (wcel A2 cr) $ >
  $ wi (wa ph (wcel (cv x3) S)) (wcel B2 V) $ >
  $ wi (wa ph (wcel (cv x3) Z)) (wcel B2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq (co cr (cmpt x3 S A2) cdv) (cmpt x3 S B2)) $ >
  $ wi (wceq (cv x3) (cv k)) (wceq B2 C) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel U cxr) $ >
