--| Lemma for ~ dchrvmasum and ~ dchrvmasumif . Apply ~ dchrisum for the function ` log ( y ) / y ` , which is decreasing above ` _e ` (or above 3, the nearest integer bound). (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 5-May-2016.)
theorem dchrvmasumlema {y1 t a c: setvar} (ph: wff y1 a) (D c_1 F: class a) (G: class y1 t a c) (L: class) (N: class a) (X: class) (Z: class t a c):
