--| Lemma for ~ dchrvmasumif . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 5-May-2016.)
theorem dchrvmasumiflem1 {x3 y1 k a d: setvar} (ph: wff y1 a) (C: class k a) (D: class a d) (S: class a) (T: class k a) (c_1: class a d) (E: class k a) (F: class a) (G: class x3 y1 k a d) (K: class x3 a d) (L: class) (N: class a d) (X: class) (Z: class a d):
