  $ wi ph (wcel (cmpt x3 crp (csu d (co c1 (cfv (cv x3) cfl) cfz) (co (co (cfv (cfv (cv d) L) X) (co (cfv (cv d) cmu) (cv d) cdiv) cmul) (co (csu k (co c1 (cfv (co (cv x3) (cv d) cdiv) cfl) cfz) (co (cfv (cfv (cv k) L) X) (co (cfv (cif (wceq S cc0) (co (cv x3) (cv d) cdiv) (cv k)) clog) (cv k) cdiv) cmul)) (cif (wceq S cc0) cc0 T) cmin) cmul))) co1) $;

--| Lemma for ~ dchrvmasum . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 5-May-2016.)
theorem dchrvmasumiflem2 {x3 y1 n a: setvar} (ph: wff y1 a) (C D S T c_1: class a) (E: class n a) (F: class a) (G: class x3 y1 n a) (K: class x3 n a) (L: class) (N: class a) (X: class) (Z: class a):
