  $ wceq N (cfv (co (co (cfv Z clog) (cfv K clog) cdiv) c2 cdiv) cfl) $ >
  $ wi (wa ph (wcel J (co M N cfz))) (wa (wbr X (co K J cexp) clt) (wbr (co K J cexp) (cfv Z csqrt) cle)) $;

--| Lemma for ~ pnt . The "naive" base bound, which we will slightly improve. (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 13-Apr-2016.)
theorem pntlemn {z a: setvar} (ph: wff z a) (A2 B2: class z a) (C: class a) (D: class z a) (R U: class a) (E: class) (F: class z a) (J K L M N W X Y Z: class a):
