  $ wceq N (cfv (co (co (cfv Z clog) (cfv K clog) cdiv) c2 cdiv) cfl) $ >
  $ wi ph (wral z (wbr (cfv (co (cfv (cv z) R) (cv z) cdiv) cabs) U cle) (co Y cpnf cico)) $ >
