--| Lemma for ~ pntlemj . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 7-Jun-2016.)
theorem pntlemq {y1 z u a: setvar} (ph: wff y1 z u a) (A2 B2: class y1 z u a) (C: class y1 u a) (D: class y1 z u a) (R: class a) (U: class y1 u a) (E: class) (F I: class y1 z u a) (J K: class u a) (L: class a) (M N O: class y1 u a) (V: class y1 z a) (W: class y1 u a) (X: class u a) (Y: class y1 u a) (Z: class y1 a):
  $ wceq R (cmpt a crp (co (cfv (cv a) cchp) (cv a) cmin)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 crp) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel B2 crp) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel L (co cc0 c1 cioo)) $ >
