  $ wi ph (wbr (co (co U E cmin) (co (co (co L E cmul) c8 cdiv) (cfv Z clog) cmul) cmul) (csu n O (co (co (co U (cv n) cdiv) (cfv (co (cfv (co Z (cv n) cdiv) R) Z cdiv) cabs) cmin) (cfv (cv n) clog) cmul)) cle) $;

--| Lemma for ~ pnt . Eliminate some assumptions from ~ pntlemj . (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 13-Apr-2016.)
theorem pntlemi {y1 z u n a: setvar} (ph: wff y1 z u a) (A2 B2: class y1 z u n a) (C: class y1 u n a) (D: class y1 z u n a) (R: class a) (U: class y1 u a) (E: class) (F: class y1 z u n a) (J K: class u a) (L: class a) (M N O W: class y1 u a) (X: class u a) (Y: class y1 u a) (Z: class y1 a):
