--| Lemma for ~ noinfbnd1 . Establish a hard lower bound when there is no minimum. (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 9-Aug-2024.)
theorem noinfbnd1lem6 {x3 y1 v u g2: setvar} (B2: class) (T: class x3 y1 v u g2) (U: class u g2) (V: class x3 y1 v u):
