--| Lemma for surreal multiplication. Instantiate some variables. (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 4-Mar-2025.)
theorem mulsproplem1 {e f2 a b c d: setvar} (ph: wff e f2 a b c d) (A2 B2 C D: class) (T: class a b c d) (U: class e a b c d) (E F: class) (W: class a b c) (X: class) (Y: class a) (Z: class a b):
