theorem mulsuniflem {w v u t s1 r q p a b c d: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2 B2: class) (R: class u q a c) (S: class v p a d) (L: class w s1 b d) (M: class t r b c):
  $ wi ph (wbr L R cslts) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr M S cslts) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq A2 (co L R ccuts)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq B2 (co M S ccuts)) $ >
