--| Value of the addition operation in the angle addition magma, in case the first angle is neither zero nor flat. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 23-Aug-2026.)
theorem angmgmaddov1 {e f2 s1 d: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2: class e f2 s1 d) (P: class e f2) (c_pl: class e f2 s1 d) (c_sm: class e f2 d) (S U: class) (G I: class e f2) (L: class) (c_mi: class e f2) (V W X Y Z: class):
  $ wceq P (cfv G cbs) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (crab d (wa (wne (cfv cc0 (cv d)) (cfv c1 (cv d))) (wne (cfv c1 (cv d)) (cfv c2 (cv d)))) (co P (co cc0 c3 cfzo) cmap)) $ >
  $ wceq I (cfv G citv) $ >
  $ wceq c_mi (cfv G cds) $ >
  $ wceq c_sm (cfv G ccgra) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv G clng) $ >
