--| Addition of angles is compatible with angle congruence. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 23-Aug-2026.)
theorem angmgmaddcpbl {e f2 s1 d: setvar} (ph: wff) (A2: class e f2 s1 d) (C D P: class) (c_pl: class e f2 s1 d) (c_sm E F: class) (G: class e f2) (I L c_mi: class):
