  $ wceq A2 (crab d (wa (wne (cfv cc0 (cv d)) (cfv c1 (cv d))) (wne (cfv c1 (cv d)) (cfv c2 (cv d)))) (co P (co cc0 c3 cfzo) cmap)) $ >
  $ wceq I (cfv G citv) $ >
