--| Lemma 8 for ~ 3wlkd . (Contributed by Alexander van der Vekens, 12-Nov-2017.) (Revised by AV, 7-Feb-2021.)
theorem _3wlkdlem8 (ph: wff) (A2 B2 C D P F I J K L V: class):
  $ wceq P (cs4 A2 B2 C D) $ >
  $ wceq F (cs3 J K L) $ >
