  $ wceq I (cmpt c (cdif O E) (cinf (crab k (wceq (cfv (cv k) (cfv (cv c) F)) cc0) (co c1 (co M N caddc) cfz)) cr clt)) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel C (cdif O E)) (wn (wcel c1 C))) (wne (cfv C I) c1) $;

--| The first tie cannot be reached at the first pick. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 4-Apr-2017.)
theorem ballotlemii {x3 i k c: setvar} (C: class x3 c) (P: class x3 i k c) (E F: class x3) (I: class x3 c) (M N O: class x3):
