  $ wi (wcel C (cdif O E)) (wrex z (wa (wral w (wn (wbr (cv w) (cv z) clt)) (crab k (wceq (cfv (cv k) (cfv C F)) cc0) (co c1 (co M N caddc) cfz))) (wral w (wi (wbr (cv z) (cv w) clt) (wrex y1 (wbr (cv y1) (cv w) clt) (crab k (wceq (cfv (cv k) (cfv C F)) cc0) (co c1 (co M N caddc) cfz)))) cr)) cr) $;

--| ` ( I `` C ) ` is the first tie. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 1-Dec-2016.) (Revised by AV, 6-Oct-2020.)
theorem ballotlemimin {x3 i k c: setvar} (C: class x3 c) (P: class x3 i k c) (E F: class x3) (I: class x3 c) (M N O: class x3):
