  $ wi (wa (wcel C (cdif O E)) (wn (wcel c1 C))) (wcel (cfv C I) C) $;

--| If the first vote is for A, the vote on the first tie is for B. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 4-Apr-2017.)
theorem ballotlem1c {x3 i k c: setvar} (C: class x3 c) (P: class x3 i k c) (E F: class x3) (I: class x3 c) (M N O: class x3):
