  $ wceq R (cmpt c (cdif O E) (cima (cfv (cv c) S) (cv c))) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel C (cdif O E)) (wcel J (co c1 (co M N caddc) cfz))) (wb (wcel J (cfv C R)) (wcel (cif (wbr J (cfv C I) cle) (co (co (cfv C I) c1 caddc) J cmin) J) C)) $;

