--| Value of ` R ` after the tie. (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 11-Apr-2017.)
theorem ballotlemrv2 {x3 i k c: setvar} (C: class x3 c) (P R: class x3 i k c) (S E F I: class x3) (J: class x3 i c) (M N O: class x3):
  $ wcel M cn $ >
  $ wcel N cn $ >
  $ wceq O (crab c (wceq (cfv (cv c) chash) M) (cpw (co c1 (co M N caddc) cfz))) $ >
