--| First-order logic and set theory. (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj919 {n: setvar} (ph ps ch: wff n) (D P F: class) (bnjwphm bnjwpsm bnjwchm: wff n):
  $ wb ch (w_bnj17 (wcel (cv n) D) (wfn F (cv n)) ph ps) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphm (wsbc n ph P) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsm (wsbc n ps P) $ >
  $ wb bnjwchm (wsbc n ch P) $ >
  $ wcel P cvv $ >
  $ wb bnjwchm (w_bnj17 (wcel P D) (wfn F P) bnjwphm bnjwpsm) $;

--| First-order logic and set theory. (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj923 (D: class) (n: setvar):
