--| Technical lemma for ~ bnj69 . This lemma may no longer be used or have become an indirect lemma of the theorem in question (i.e. a lemma of a lemma... of the theorem). (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj945 {f2 n: setvar} (A2 C G: class f2 n) (p: setvar):
  $ wceq G (cun (cv f2) (csn (cop (cv n) C))) $ >
  $ wi (w_bnj17 (wcel C cvv) (wfn (cv f2) (cv n)) (wceq (cv p) (csuc (cv n))) (wcel A2 (cv n))) (wceq (cfv A2 G) (cfv A2 (cv f2))) $;

