--| Technical lemma for ~ bnj852 . This lemma may no longer be used or have become an indirect lemma of the theorem in question (i.e. a lemma of a lemma... of the theorem). (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj607 {x3 y1 f2 h i m n p: setvar} (ph ps: wff x3 y1 f2 i n) (ch: wff x3 y1 f2 h i m n p) (th: wff x3 y1 f2 h i m n) (ta: wff x3 y1 f2 h i m n p) (et: wff x3 y1 h i m n p) (A2: class x3 y1 i n) (D: class x3 y1 f2 h i m n p) (R: class x3 y1 i n) (G: class x3 f2 m n p) (bnjwphm bnjwpsm bnjwchm bnjwphn bnjwpsn ph0 ps0 ph1 ps1: wff x3 y1 f2 h i m n p):
  $ wb th (wral m (wi (wbr (cv m) (cv n) cep) (wsbc n ch (cv m))) D) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphn (wsbc f2 ph G) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsn (wsbc f2 ps G) $ >
  $ wb ta (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv m)) bnjwphm bnjwpsm) $ >
  $ wb et (w_bnj17 (wcel (cv m) D) (wceq (cv n) (csuc (cv m))) (wcel (cv p) com) (wceq (cv m) (csuc (cv p)))) $ >
  $ wcel G cvv $ >
  $ wb bnjwchm (wi (wa (w_bnj15 A2 R) (wcel (cv x3) A2)) (weu f2 (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv m)) bnjwphm bnjwpsm))) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphn (wceq (cfv c0 G) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv x3))) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsn (wral i (wi (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wceq (cfv (csuc (cv i)) G) (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) G) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))))) com) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wne (cv n) c1o) (wcel (cv n) D)) (wex m (wex p et)) $ >
  $ wi (w3a th (wcel (cv m) D) (wbr (cv m) (cv n) cep)) bnjwchm $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w_bnj15 A2 R) ta et) (wfn G (cv n)) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w_bnj15 A2 R) ta et) bnjwphn $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w_bnj15 A2 R) ta et) bnjwpsn $ >
  $ wb ph (wceq (cfv c0 (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv x3))) $ >
  $ wb ps (wral i (wi (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wceq (cfv (csuc (cv i)) (cv f2)) (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))))) com) $ >
  $ wb ph0 (wsbc f2 ph (cv h)) $ >
  $ wb ps0 (wsbc f2 ps (cv h)) $ >
  $ wb ph1 (wsbc h ph0 G) $ >
  $ wb ps1 (wsbc h ps0 G) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wne (cv n) c1o) (wcel (cv n) D) th) (wi (wa (w_bnj15 A2 R) (wcel (cv x3) A2)) (wex f2 (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv n)) ph ps))) $;

