--| Technical lemma for ~ bnj852 . This lemma may no longer be used or have become an indirect lemma of the theorem in question (i.e. a lemma of a lemma... of the theorem). (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj600 {x3 y1 f2 i m n p: setvar} (ph ps: wff x3 y1 f2 i n) (ch: wff x3 y1 f2 i m n p) (th: wff x3 y1 f2 i m n) (ta: wff x3 y1 f2 i m n p) (et: wff x3 y1 m n p) (ze si rh: wff x3 y1 f2 i m n p) (A2: class x3) (B2 C: class x3 y1 f2 i m n p) (D: class x3 y1 i m n) (R: class x3) (G: class x3 f2 m n p) (K L: class x3 y1 f2 i m n p) (bnjwphm: wff x3 y1 f2 m n) (bnjwpsm bnjwchm bnjwphn bnjwpsn bnjwchn: wff x3 y1 f2 i m n p):
  $ wb ph (wceq (cfv c0 (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv x3))) $ >
  $ wb ps (wral i (wi (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wceq (cfv (csuc (cv i)) (cv f2)) (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))))) com) $ >
  $ wceq D (cdif com (csn c0)) $ >
  $ wb ch (wi (wa (w_bnj15 A2 R) (wcel (cv x3) A2)) (weu f2 (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv n)) ph ps))) $ >
  $ wb th (wral m (wi (wbr (cv m) (cv n) cep) (wsbc n ch (cv m))) D) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphm (wsbc n ph (cv m)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsm (wsbc n ps (cv m)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwchm (wsbc n ch (cv m)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphn (wsbc f2 ph G) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsn (wsbc f2 ps G) $ >
  $ wb bnjwchn (wsbc f2 ch G) $ >
  $ wceq G (cun (cv f2) (csn (cop (cv m) (ciun y1 (cfv (cv p) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1)))))) $ >
  $ wb ta (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv m)) bnjwphm bnjwpsm) $ >
  $ wb si (w3a (wcel (cv m) D) (wceq (cv n) (csuc (cv m))) (wcel (cv p) (cv m))) $ >
  $ wb et (w_bnj17 (wcel (cv m) D) (wceq (cv n) (csuc (cv m))) (wcel (cv p) com) (wceq (cv m) (csuc (cv p)))) $ >
  $ wb ze (w3a (wcel (cv i) com) (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wceq (cv m) (csuc (cv i)))) $ >
  $ wb rh (w3a (wcel (cv i) com) (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wne (cv m) (csuc (cv i)))) $ >
  $ wceq B2 (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))) $ >
  $ wceq C (ciun y1 (cfv (cv p) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))) $ >
  $ wceq K (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) G) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))) $ >
  $ wceq L (ciun y1 (cfv (cv p) G) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))) $ >
  $ wceq G (cun (cv f2) (csn (cop (cv m) C))) $ >
  $ wi (wne (cv n) c1o) (wi (wa (wcel (cv n) D) th) ch) $;

