--| Technical lemma for ~ bnj69 . This lemma may no longer be used or have become an indirect lemma of the theorem in question (i.e. a lemma of a lemma... of the theorem). (Contributed by Jonathan Ben-Naim, 3-Jun-2011.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem bnj1030 {y1 z f2 i j n: setvar} (ph: wff y1 z f2 j n) (ps: wff y1 z f2 i j n) (ch: wff y1 z f2 i n) (th ta: wff y1) (et: wff y1 z f2 i n) (ze si rh: wff y1 z f2 i j n) (A2: class) (B2: class j) (D: class y1 z f2 n) (R: class) (K: class y1 z f2 i j n) (X: class j) (bnjwphm bnjwpsm bnjwchm bnjwthm bnjwtam bnjwetm bnjwzem ph0: wff y1 z f2 i j n):
  $ wb ph (wceq (cfv c0 (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R X)) $ >
  $ wb ps (wral i (wi (wcel (csuc (cv i)) (cv n)) (wceq (cfv (csuc (cv i)) (cv f2)) (ciun y1 (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)) (c_bnj14 A2 R (cv y1))))) com) $ >
  $ wb ch (w_bnj17 (wcel (cv n) D) (wfn (cv f2) (cv n)) ph ps) $ >
  $ wb th (wa (w_bnj15 A2 R) (wcel X A2)) $ >
  $ wb ta (w3a (wcel B2 cvv) (w_bnj19 A2 B2 R) (wss (c_bnj14 A2 R X) B2)) $ >
  $ wb ze (wa (wcel (cv i) (cv n)) (wcel (cv z) (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)))) $ >
  $ wceq D (cdif com (csn c0)) $ >
  $ wceq K (cab f2 (wrex n (w3a (wfn (cv f2) (cv n)) ph ps) D)) $ >
  $ wb et (wi (wa (wcel (cv f2) K) (wcel (cv i) (cdm (cv f2)))) (wss (cfv (cv i) (cv f2)) B2)) $ >
  $ wb rh (wral j (wi (wbr (cv j) (cv i) cep) (wsbc i et (cv j))) (cv n)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwphm (wsbc i ph (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwpsm (wsbc i ps (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwchm (wsbc i ch (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwthm (wsbc i th (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwtam (wsbc i ta (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwzem (wsbc i ze (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb bnjwetm (wsbc i et (cv j)) $ >
  $ wb si (wi (wa (wcel (cv j) (cv n)) (wbr (cv j) (cv i) cep)) bnjwetm) $ >
  $ wb ph0 (w_bnj17 (wcel (cv i) (cv n)) si (wcel (cv f2) K) (wcel (cv i) (cdm (cv f2)))) $ >
  $ wi (wa th ta) (wss (c_bnj18 A2 R X) B2) $;

