theorem cvmlift3lem7 {x3 z f2 g2 k s1 b c d: setvar} (ph: wff z g2 k s1 b c d) (A2: class x3 g2) (B2: class k s1 c) (C: class) (P: class k s1) (S: class z g2 k s1 c d) (T: class x3 z f2 g2 k) (F: class) (G: class s1) (H: class k s1) (J: class z) (K: class k s1 d) (M: class z k s1 b c d) (O: class k s1 d) (V: class x3 z f2 g2 k s1 b c d) (W: class z g2 k s1 b) (X: class k s1) (Y: class k s1 b c d):
  $ wceq B2 (cuni C) $ >
  $ wceq Y (cuni K) $ >
