  $ wi ph (wf (co cc0 (co N c1 cmin) cfz) (co (co cc0 K cfz) (co c1 N cfz) cmap) F) $ >
  $ wi ph (wrmo z (wceq (cfv (cv z) c2nd) N) S) $;

--| Lemma for ~ poimir , that the face in ~ poimirlem22 is a face. (Contributed by Brendan Leahy, 21-Aug-2020.)
