--| Lemma for ~ poimir establishing the vertices of the simplex of ~ poimirlem17 . (Contributed by Brendan Leahy, 21-Aug-2020.)
theorem poimirlem16 {y1 t f2 j n p: setvar} (ph: wff f2) (S: class f2) (T F: class) (K: class y1) (N: class):
  $ wi ph (wcel N cn) $ >
  $ wceq S (crab t (wceq F (cmpt y1 (co cc0 (co N c1 cmin) cfz) (csb j (cif (wbr (cv y1) (cfv (cv t) c2nd) clt) (cv y1) (co (cv y1) c1 caddc)) (co (cfv (cfv (cv t) c1st) c1st) (cun (cxp (cima (cfv (cfv (cv t) c1st) c2nd) (co c1 (cv j) cfz)) (csn c1)) (cxp (cima (cfv (cfv (cv t) c1st) c2nd) (co (co (cv j) c1 caddc) N cfz)) (csn cc0))) (cof caddc))))) (cxp (cxp (co (co cc0 K cfzo) (co c1 N cfz) cmap) (cab f2 (wf1o (co c1 N cfz) (co c1 N cfz) (cv f2)))) (co cc0 N cfz))) $ >
  $ wi ph (wf (co cc0 (co N c1 cmin) cfz) (co (co cc0 K cfz) (co c1 N cfz) cmap) F) $ >
