  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wceq V (cfv K clvol) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel K chlt) (w3a (wcel P A2) (wcel Q A2) (wcel R A2))) (wn (wcel (co (co P Q c_or) R c_or) V)) $;

--| The join of two atoms is not a lattice volume. (Contributed by NM, 17-Jul-2012.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem _2atnelvolN (A2 P Q c_or K V: class):
