--| Lemma for ~ dath . Analogue of ~ dalem25 for ` H ` . (Contributed by NM, 4-Aug-2012.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem dalem31N {c d: setvar} (ph ps: wff c d) (A2 C P Q R S T U H c_or K c_le c_an O Y Z: class c d):
  $ wb ph (w3a (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel C (cfv K cbs))) (w3a (wcel P A2) (wcel Q A2) (wcel R A2)) (w3a (wcel S A2) (wcel T A2) (wcel U A2))) (wa (wcel Y O) (wcel Z O)) (w3a (w3a (wn (wbr C (co P Q c_or) c_le)) (wn (wbr C (co Q R c_or) c_le)) (wn (wbr C (co R P c_or) c_le))) (w3a (wn (wbr C (co S T c_or) c_le)) (wn (wbr C (co T U c_or) c_le)) (wn (wbr C (co U S c_or) c_le))) (w3a (wbr C (co P S c_or) c_le) (wbr C (co Q T c_or) c_le) (wbr C (co R U c_or) c_le)))) $ >
