  $ wi (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel (cv r) A2)) (w3a (wcel (cv x3) A2) (wcel (cv y1) A2) (wcel (cv z) A2)) (wa (wn (wbr (cv r) (co (cv x3) (cv y1) c_or) c_le)) (wbr (cv r) (co (cv y1) (cv z) c_or) c_le))) (wbr (cv z) (co (cv r) (cv y1) c_or) c_le) $;

--| Lemma for ~ paddass . Restate projective space axiom ~ ps-2 . (Contributed by NM, 8-Jan-2012.)
