  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel P A2)) (w3a (wcel X B2) (wcel Y B2) (wcel Z B2)) (wbr (co X P c_an) Z c_le)) (wceq (co (co X P c_an) (co Y Z c_an) c_or) (co (co (co X P c_an) Y c_or) Z c_an)) $;

--| Version of modular law ~ pmod1i that holds in a Hilbert lattice, when one element is an atom. (Contributed by NM, 14-May-2012.) (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 10-May-2013.)
