--| Version of modular law that holds in a Hilbert lattice, when one element is an atom. (Contributed by NM, 10-Jun-2012.) (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 10-May-2013.)
theorem atmod4i1 (A2 B2 P c_or K c_le c_an X Y: class):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
