--| Lemma for ~ dalaw . Special case to eliminate the requirement ` -. ( ( P .\/ S ) ./\ ( Q .\/ T ) ) .<_ ( Q .\/ R ) ` in ~ dalawlem1 . (Contributed by NM, 6-Oct-2012.)
theorem dalawlem8 (A2 P Q R S T U c_or K c_le c_an: class):
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
