--| Lemma for ~ 4atexlem7 . Swap ` Q ` and ` R ` , so that theorems involving ` C ` can be reused for ` D ` . Note that ` U ` must be expanded because it involves ` Q ` . (Contributed by NM, 25-Nov-2012.)
theorem _4atexlemswapqr (ph: wff) (A2 P Q R S T U H c_or K c_le c_an V W: class):
  $ wb ph (w3a (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wa (wcel P A2) (wn (wbr P W c_le))) (wa (wcel Q A2) (wn (wbr Q W c_le)))) (w3a (wcel S A2) (w3a (wcel R A2) (wn (wbr R W c_le)) (wceq (co P R c_or) (co Q R c_or))) (wa (wcel T A2) (wceq (co U T c_or) (co V T c_or)))) (wa (wne P Q) (wn (wbr S (co P Q c_or) c_le)))) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wceq U (co (co P Q c_or) W c_an) $ >
  $ wi ph (w3a (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wa (wcel P A2) (wn (wbr P W c_le))) (wa (wcel R A2) (wn (wbr R W c_le)))) (w3a (wcel S A2) (w3a (wcel Q A2) (wn (wbr Q W c_le)) (wceq (co P Q c_or) (co R Q c_or))) (wa (wcel T A2) (wceq (co (co (co P R c_or) W c_an) T c_or) (co V T c_or)))) (wa (wne P R) (wn (wbr S (co P R c_or) c_le)))) $;

