--| Part of proof of Lemma E in [Crawley] p. 113. (Contributed by NM, 9-Nov-2012.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem cdleme0moN {r: setvar} (A2 P Q R U: class) (H: class r) (c_or: class) (K c_le c_an W: class r):
