--| Part of proof of Lemma E in [Crawley] p. 113, 1st sentence of 3rd paragraph on p. 114. ` F ` and ` G ` represent f(s) and f(t) respectively. Their proof provides no details of our ~ cdleme11a through ~ cdleme11 , so there may be a simpler proof that we have overlooked. (Contributed by NM, 15-Jun-2012.)
