--| Part of proof of Lemma E in [Crawley] p. 113, 3rd paragraph on p. 114, "<s,t,p> and <f(s),f(t),q> are centrally perspective". ` F ` and ` G ` represent f(s) and f(t) respectively. (Contributed by NM, 7-Oct-2012.)
