--| Part of proof of Lemma E in [Crawley] p. 113. ~ cdleme22f with s and t swapped (this case is not mentioned by them). If s ` <_ ` t ` \/ ` v, then f(s) ` <_ ` f_s(t) ` \/ ` v. (Contributed by NM, 7-Dec-2012.)
theorem cdleme22f2 (A2 P Q S T U F H c_or K c_le c_an N V W: class):
