  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (w3a (wcel (cv s1) A2) (wa (wcel X B2) (wn (wbr X W c_le))) (wcel Y B2)) (wa (wceq (co (cv s1) (co X W c_an) c_or) X) (wbr X Y c_le))) (wceq (co (cv s1) (co Y W c_an) c_or) Y) $;

--| Part of proof of Lemma E in [Crawley] p. 113. (Contributed by NM, 25-Feb-2013.)
