theorem cdlemefrs29clN {z s1: setvar} (ph: wff s1) (ps: wff) (A2 B2 P Q R H c_or K c_le c_an: class) (N: class s1) (O: class z s1) (W: class):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
