theorem cdlemefrs32fva1 {x3 z s1: setvar} (ph: wff x3 s1) (ps: wff x3) (A2 B2 P Q R: class) (F: class x3 z s1) (H: class x3) (c_or: class) (K: class x3) (c_le c_an: class) (N: class s1) (O: class x3 z s1) (W: class):
