theorem cdlemg2ce {x3 y1 z t s1 q p: setvar} (ph ps: wff x3 y1 z t s1) (ch: wff x3 y1 z t s1 q p) (A2: class) (B2: class q p) (D: class t q p) (T: class x3 y1 z t s1) (U: class q p) (E: class t s1 q p) (F: class x3 y1 z t s1) (G: class x3 y1 z t s1 q p) (H: class) (c_or: class q p) (K c_le: class) (c_an: class q p) (W: class):
