--| Part of proof of Lemma G in [Crawley] p. 116, line 19. Show p ` \/ ` q = p ` \/ ` u. TODO: reformat ~ cdleme0cp to match this, then replace with ~ cdleme0cp . (Contributed by NM, 19-Apr-2013.)
