--| Given two atoms not under the fiducial co-atom ` W ` , there is a third. Lemma B in [Crawley] p. 112. TODO: Is there a simpler more direct proof, that could be placed earlier e.g. near ~ lhpexle ? Then replace ~ cdlemb2 with it. This is a more general version of ~ cdlemb2 without ` P =/= Q ` condition. (Contributed by NM, 27-Apr-2013.)
