--| Part of proof of Lemma K of [Crawley] p. 118. TODO: clean up ` ( b Y G ) ` stuff. ` V ` represents ` Y ` in ~ cdlemk31 . (Contributed by NM, 21-Jul-2013.)
theorem cdlemky {e f2 g2 i j b d: setvar} (A2: class e f2 g2 b d) (B2: class e f2 i j b d) (P R: class b) (S: class f2 g2 i) (T: class b) (F: class e g2 b d) (G: class f2 i b) (H: class e f2 g2 b d) (c_or: class b) (K c_le: class e f2 g2 b d) (c_an: class b) (N: class e g2 b d) (V: class e f2 g2 i j b d) (W: class g2 b) (Y: class e f2 g2 i j b d) (Z: class e f2 i j b d):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq T (cfv W (cfv K cltrn)) $ >
  $ wceq R (cfv W (cfv K ctrl)) $ >
  $ wceq Z (co (co P (cfv (cv b) R) c_or) (co (cfv P N) (cfv (ccom (cv b) (ccnv F)) R) c_or) c_an) $ >
  $ wceq Y (co (co P (cfv (cv g2) R) c_or) (co Z (cfv (ccom (cv g2) (ccnv (cv b))) R) c_or) c_an) $ >
  $ wceq S (cmpt f2 T (crio i (wceq (cfv P (cv i)) (co (co P (cfv (cv f2) R) c_or) (co (cfv P N) (cfv (ccom (cv f2) (ccnv F)) R) c_or) c_an)) T)) $ >
  $ wceq V (cmpo d e T T (crio j (wceq (cfv P (cv j)) (co (co P (cfv (cv e) R) c_or) (co (cfv P (cfv (cv d) S)) (cfv (ccom (cv e) (ccnv (cv d))) R) c_or) c_an)) T)) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wa (wcel F T) (wne F (cres cid B2))) (wa (wcel G T) (wne G (cres cid B2)))) (w3a (wcel N T) (wa (wcel P A2) (wn (wbr P W c_le))) (wceq (cfv F R) (cfv N R))) (wa (wcel (cv b) T) (w3a (wne (cv b) (cres cid B2)) (wne (cfv (cv b) R) (cfv F R)) (wne (cfv (cv b) R) (cfv G R))))) (wceq (csb g2 G Y) (cfv P (co (cv b) G V))) $;

