theorem cdlemk19w {z g2 b: setvar} (A2 B2 P R T: class) (U: class z g2 b) (F H c_or K c_an N: class) (c_pe: class z g2 b) (W: class) (X: class z g2 b) (Y: class g2 b) (Z: class z b):
