--| An endomorphism ring is a ring. TODO: fix comment. (Contributed by NM, 4-Aug-2013.)
theorem eringring (D H K W: class):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv W (cfv K cedring)) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wcel D crg) $;

--| An endomorphism ring is a division ring. TODO: fix comment. (Contributed by NM, 11-Aug-2013.)
theorem erngdv (D H K W: class):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv W (cfv K cedring)) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wcel D cdr) $;

--| The division ring zero of an endomorphism ring. (Contributed by NM, 5-Nov-2013.) (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 23-Jun-2014.)
theorem erng0g {f2: setvar} (B2: class) (D: class f2) (T H K: class) (O: class f2) (W: class) (c_0: class f2):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
