--| Value of isomorphism H at the fiducial hyperplane ` W ` . (Contributed by NM, 25-Aug-2014.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem dihwN {f2: setvar} (ph: wff f2) (B2 T H I: class f2) (K W: class) (c_0: class f2):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq T (cfv W (cfv K cltrn)) $ >
  $ wceq c_0 (cmpt f2 T (cres cid B2)) $ >
  $ wceq I (cfv W (cfv K cdih)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq (cfv W I) (cxp T (csn c_0))) $;

