theorem dihmeetlem1N {h q: setvar} (A2 B2: class) (P: class q) (R: class h q) (T: class q) (E G: class h q) (H: class) (I: class h) (c_or: class h q) (K c_le: class) (c_an: class h) (W: class) (X Y: class h) (c_0: class h q):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq I (cfv W (cfv K cdih)) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_or (cfv K cjn) $ >
  $ wceq A2 (cfv K catm) $ >
