--| Lemma for isomorphism H of a GLB. (Contributed by NM, 19-Mar-2014.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem dihglblem2aN {v u: setvar} (B2: class v) (S: class) (T G H K c_le: class v u) (c_an W: class):
  $ wceq B2 (cfv K cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_le (cfv K cple) $ >
  $ wceq c_an (cfv K cmee) $ >
  $ wceq G (cfv K cglb) $ >
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq T (crab u (wrex v (wceq (cv u) (co (cv v) W c_an)) S) B2) $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wa (wss S B2) (wne S c0))) (wne T c0) $;

--| The GLB of a set of lattice elements ` S ` is the same as that of the set ` T ` with elements of ` S ` cut down to be under ` W ` . (Contributed by NM, 19-Mar-2014.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem dihglblem2N {v u: setvar} (B2: class v) (S: class) (T G H K c_le: class v u) (c_an W: class):
