  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq T (crab u (wrex v (wceq (cv u) (co (cv v) W c_an)) S) B2) $ >
  $ wi (w3a (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) (wss S B2) (wbr (cfv S G) W c_le)) (wceq (cfv S G) (cfv T G)) $;

