--| Lemma for ~ lclkr . Construct a vector ` B ` that makes the sum of functionals zero. Combine with ` B e. V ` to shorten overall proof. (Contributed by NM, 17-Jan-2015.)
theorem lclkrlem2m (ph: wff) (B2 D c_pl S c_x c_xp U E F G I c_mi V X Y c_0: class):
  $ wceq V (cfv U cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv U cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv U csca) $ >
  $ wceq c_xp (cfv S cmulr) $ >
  $ wceq c_0 (cfv S c0g) $ >
