--| Lemma for ~ lclkr . ~ lclkrlem2t with ` X ` and ` Y ` swapped. (Contributed by NM, 18-Jan-2015.)
theorem lclkrlem2u (ph: wff) (D c_pl c_po S c_x c_xp U E F G H I K L c_mi N c_pe V W X Y c_0: class):
