--| Scalar product for the closed kernel vector space dual. (Contributed by NM, 28-Mar-2015.)
theorem lcdvs (ph: wff) (C D c_xb c_x U H K W: class):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq U (cfv W (cfv K cdvh)) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv U cld) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv D cvsca) $ >
  $ wceq C (cfv W (cfv K clcd)) $ >
  $ wceq c_xb (cfv C cvsca) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) $ >
