--| Value of scalar product operation value for the closed kernel vector space dual. (Contributed by NM, 28-Mar-2015.)
theorem lcdvsval (ph: wff) (A2 C R S c_xb c_x U F G H K V W X: class):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq U (cfv W (cfv K cdvh)) $ >
  $ wceq V (cfv U cbs) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv U csca) $ >
  $ wceq R (cfv S cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_x (cfv S cmulr) $ >
  $ wceq C (cfv W (cfv K clcd)) $ >
  $ wceq F (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq c_xb (cfv C cvsca) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) $ >
