  $ wi ph (wcel G F) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 V) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq (cfv A2 (co X G c_xb)) (co (cfv A2 G) X c_x)) $;

--| The scalar product operation value is a functional. (Contributed by NM, 20-Mar-2015.)
theorem lcdvscl (ph: wff) (C R S c_x U G H K V W X: class):
