theorem mapdvalc {f2 g2: setvar} (ph: wff g2) (C S: class f2 g2) (T: class g2) (U: class f2 g2) (F: class) (H: class f2 g2) (K: class g2) (L: class f2) (M: class f2 g2) (O: class f2) (W: class g2) (X: class f2 g2):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq U (cfv W (cfv K cdvh)) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv U clss) $ >
  $ wceq F (cfv U clfn) $ >
  $ wceq L (cfv U clk) $ >
  $ wceq O (cfv W (cfv K coch)) $ >
  $ wceq M (cfv W (cfv K cmpd)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wcel K X) (wcel W H)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel T S) $ >
  $ wceq C (crab g2 (wceq (cfv (cfv (cfv (cv g2) L) O) O) (cfv (cv g2) L)) F) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq (cfv T M) (crab f2 (wss (cfv (cfv (cv f2) L) O) T) C)) $;

