theorem mapdhcl {x3 h: setvar} (ph: wff x3) (C: class x3) (D: class) (Q: class h) (R: class) (U: class x3) (F: class) (H I: class x3 h) (J: class) (K: class x3 h) (M c_mi N: class) (V W: class x3 h) (X Y c_0: class):
