--| Value of map from vectors to functionals with a specific auxiliary vector. TODO: Would shorter proofs result if the .ne hypothesis were changed to two ` =/= ` hypothesis? Consider ~ hdmaplem1 through ~ hdmaplem4 , which would become obsolete. (Contributed by NM, 15-May-2015.)
theorem hdmapval2 (ph: wff) (C D S T U E H I J K N V W X: class):
