--| Part 12 in [Baer] p. 49. The map from vectors to functionals with closed kernels maps one-to-one onto. Combined with ~ hdmapadd , this shows the map is an automorphism from the additive group of vectors to the additive group of functionals with closed kernels. (Contributed by NM, 30-May-2015.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem hdmapf1oN (ph: wff) (C D S U H K V W: class):
  $ wceq H (cfv K clh) $ >
  $ wceq U (cfv W (cfv K cdvh)) $ >
  $ wceq V (cfv U cbs) $ >
  $ wceq C (cfv W (cfv K clcd)) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv C cbs) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv W (cfv K chdma)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wa (wcel K chlt) (wcel W H)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wf1o V D S) $;

