--| Lemma to construct the map out of the quotient for AKS. (Contributed by metakunt, 14-May-2025.)
theorem aks6d1c6isolem1 {x3 i a: setvar} (ph: wff i a) (R: class) (U: class i a) (F K: class x3 i a) (M: class i a):
  $ wi ph (wcel R ccmn) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel K cn) $ >
  $ wceq U (crab a (wrex i (wceq (co (cv i) (cv a) (cfv R cplusg)) (cfv R c0g)) (cfv R cbs)) (cfv R cbs)) $ >
  $ wceq F (cmpt x3 cz (co (cv x3) M (cfv (co R U cress) cmg))) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel M (co R K cprimroots)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel (co (co R U cress) (crn F) cress) cgrp) $;

--| Lemma to construct the group homomorphism for the AKS Theorem. (Contributed by metakunt, 14-May-2025.)
theorem aks6d1c6isolem2 {x3 i a: setvar} (ph: wff i a) (R: class) (U: class i a) (F K: class x3 i a) (M: class i a):
  $ wi ph (wcel R ccmn) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel K cn) $ >
  $ wceq U (crab a (wrex i (wceq (co (cv i) (cv a) (cfv R cplusg)) (cfv R c0g)) (cfv R cbs)) (cfv R cbs)) $ >
  $ wceq F (cmpt x3 cz (co (cv x3) M (cfv (co R U cress) cmg))) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel M (co R K cprimroots)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel F (co czring (co (co R U cress) (crn F) cress) cghm)) $;

--| The preimage of a map sending a primitive root to its powers of zero is equal to the set of integers that divide ` R ` . (Contributed by metakunt, 15-May-2025.)
theorem aks6d1c6isolem3 {x3 i a: setvar} (ph: wff i a) (R: class) (S: class x3 i a) (U: class i a) (F K: class x3 i a) (M: class i a):
  $ wi ph (wcel R ccmn) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel K cn) $ >
  $ wceq U (crab a (wrex i (wceq (co (cv i) (cv a) (cfv R cplusg)) (cfv R c0g)) (cfv R cbs)) (cfv R cbs)) $ >
  $ wceq F (cmpt x3 cz (co (cv x3) M (cfv (co R U cress) cmg))) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel M (co R K cprimroots)) $ >
  $ wceq S (cfv czring crsp) $ >
  $ wi ph (wceq (cfv (csn K) S) (cima (ccnv F) (csn (cfv (co R U cress) c0g)))) $;

