theorem aks6d1c7lem4 {x3 y1 e f2 p a b: setvar} (ph: wff e f2) (A2: class p) (P: class) (c_sm: class x3 y1 e f2 p b) (R: class p b) (K: class p) (M: class e f2 p) (N: class):
