  $ wceq D (cfv B2 P) $ >
  $ wceq F (co (cpw B2) B2 O) $ >
  $ wceq G (co B2 (cpw B2) O) $ >
  $ wceq H (ccom F (ccom D G)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr N M H) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel N (co (cpw (cpw B2)) B2 cmap)) $;

--| A subset being an element of a neighborhood of a point is equivalent to the complement of that subset not being a element of the convergent of that point. (Contributed by RP, 12-Jun-2021.)
theorem neicvgel1 {i j k m n o p l: setvar} (ph: wff m) (B2 D: class) (P: class i j k m n o p l) (S: class i j k n p l) (F: class m) (G: class) (H: class i j k m n o p l) (M: class m) (N: class) (O: class i j k m n o p l) (X: class i j k n o p):
  $ wceq O (cmpo i j cvv cvv (cmpt k (co (cpw (cv j)) (cv i) cmap) (cmpt l (cv j) (crab m (wcel (cv l) (cfv (cv m) (cv k))) (cv i))))) $ >
  $ wceq P (cmpt n cvv (cmpt p (co (cpw (cv n)) (cpw (cv n)) cmap) (cmpt o (cpw (cv n)) (cdif (cv n) (cfv (cdif (cv n) (cv o)) (cv p)))))) $ >
  $ wceq D (cfv B2 P) $ >
  $ wceq F (co (cpw B2) B2 O) $ >
  $ wceq G (co B2 (cpw B2) O) $ >
  $ wceq H (ccom F (ccom D G)) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr N M H) $ >
