--| Virtual deduction generalizing rule for one quantifying variable and one virtual hypothesis. ~ alrimiv is ~ gen11 without virtual deductions. (Contributed by Alan Sare, 21-Apr-2011.) (Proof modification is discouraged.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem gen11 {x3: setvar} (ph: wff) (ps: wff x3):
