--| Existential Instantiation. Virtual deduction form of ~ exlimexi . (Contributed by Alan Sare, 21-Apr-2013.) (Proof modification is discouraged.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem exinst {x3: setvar} (ph ps: wff x3):
  $ wi ps (wal x3 ps) $ >
