 y \/ y e. x ) <-> A. y e. A ( x e. y \/ y e. x \/ x = y ) ) ` <TR> <TD> 14:13: <TD> ` |- ( A. x e. A A. y e. A ( x e. y ` ` \/ x = y \/ y e. x ) <-> A. x e. A A. y e. A ( x e. y \/ y e. x ` ` \/ x = y ) ) ` <TR> <TD> 15:14,5: <TD> ` |- (. ( Ord A /\ B e. A ) ->. A. x e. A ` ` A. y e. A ( x e. y \/ y e. x \/ x = y ) ). ` <TR> <TD> 16:4,15,3: <TD> ` |- (. ( Ord A /\ B e. A ) ->. Tr B ). ` <TR> <TD> 17:16,7: <TD> ` |- (. ( Ord A /\ B e. A ) ->. Ord B ). ` <TR> <TD> qed:17: <TD> ` |- ( ( Ord A /\ B e. A ) -> Ord B ) ` </TABLE> </HTML> (Contributed by Alan Sare, 12-Feb-2012.) (Proof modification is discouraged.) (New usage is discouraged.)
theorem ordelordALTVD (A2 B2: class):
