  $ wceq E (cfv G cedg) $ >
  $ wi (wcel (cv y1) (co cc0 c5 cfzo)) (wn (wcel (cpr (cop c1 (co (co (cv y1) c2 caddc) c5 cmo)) (cop cc0 (co (co (cv y1) c1 caddc) c5 cmo))) E)) $;

