--| Lemma 4 for ~ pgnbgreunbgr . (Contributed by AV, 20-Nov-2025.)
theorem pgnbgreunbgrlem4 {y1: setvar} (E: class) (G: class y1) (K L N V X: class) (b: setvar):
  $ wceq G (co c5 c2 cgpg) $ >
