--| Lemma 2 for ~ pgnbgreunbgrlem5 . (Contributed by AV, 20-Nov-2025.)
theorem pgnbgreunbgrlem5lem2 {y1 b: setvar} (E: class b) (G: class y1 b) (K L N V X: class b):
